WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:05.900
A Notice from the Yamayuri Council
When watching
"Maria Watches Over Us ~Printemps~,"
please have the room brightly lit and
sit well away from the television set.

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:18.180
Shimako's family runs a temple.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:18.910
What?

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:20.910
I didn't know that...

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:25.550
You know how she has always kept
herself at a distance from everyone?

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:28.680
I think it is something she is
very self-conscious about.

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.980
I had no idea...

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:36.760
So, Shimako-san's had this secret she's
been unable to reveal all this time.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.930
Keeping it all to herself in her heart...

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:50.370
I'm so sorry.

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:55.040
We only get one bus every
hour on non-business days.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.050
N-Not at all...

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.360
Don't move.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:22.880
Shoguji Temple

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:34.010
So, no questions?

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:36.090
What?

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:40.860
About how I am the daughter
of a temple household,

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:45.200
and yet, I attend Lillian Girls' Academy...

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.590
About how that is contradictory...

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:01.650
The maidens, who flock to
Maria-sama's garden,

00:02:01.650 --> 00:02:06.420
pass through the tall gates today yet
again with innocent, angelic smiles.

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:11.220
Their pure hearts and bodies are
clad in deep-colored uniforms.

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:14.090
So that the pleats of their
skirts are not disturbed...

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:17.560
...and so that their white sailor
collars are not set aflutter,

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:20.900
it is customary here to walk
slowly and with decorum.

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:26.400
The Private Lillian Girls' Academy,
a garden of maidens.

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:39.350
Maria Watches Over Us
Printemps

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:48.560
In the morning mist,
Asamoya no naka

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:55.470
the white path goes on.
tsuzuku shiroi michi

00:02:56.240 --> 00:03:02.970
The birds sing.
Tori no saezuri

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:10.610
We exchange greetings.
Aisatsu kawashinagara

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:18.090
At times, the clouds hang low,
Toki ni kumo ga tarekomete

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:25.570
and the sun may grow dim.
hizashi kagerou tomo

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:33.670
But I will walk with my chin up,
Sesuji nobashite aruku

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:41.150
for I know,
watashi wa shitteru kara

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:48.190
that above those heavy clouds...
omoi kumo no ue wa

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:56.120
...is the blue sky.
aoi sora

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:02.930
The Cherry Tree Among the Gingkos

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:13.710
You see, I wanted to become a nun.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:14.610
What?

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.540
When I was little, I was so naïve.

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:21.020
But gradually, you become more
aware of your surroundings, right?

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:24.330
And when that happened, I began
to feel my dream for my future...

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.850
...was something I must not speak about.

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:31.130
But my yearning grew more and more,

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:35.530
and I finally told my father when
I was in the sixth grade.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:36.730
What did you say?

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.510
That I would join the convent when I turned 12,

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:42.880
so I wanted him to disown me.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:43.670
What?!

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:48.680
You don't look it at all, but you're
actually very bold, aren't you?

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.050
My parents were hasty to respond,

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:53.990
saying I should first enroll
at a Catholic school,

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:56.750
and properly study there
before I made my decision.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:59.220
And thus, Lillian?

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:05.060
One upperclassman, who has
graduated, knew about this,

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:07.760
but there is no one now.

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:09.330
Just you.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:11.710
You keep this a secret at school?

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:14.370
It was a promise I made with my father.

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:16.370
At school and outside,

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:19.080
we are to keep it a secret that
I am the daughter of Shoguji...

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:22.410
...and that I am attending a Catholic school.

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:24.650
It's a large temple,

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:27.950
so I imagine it could be troublesome
if the patrons found out.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:33.950
I feel better now somehow.

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:39.230
Shimako-san, could it be that you
intend to drop out of school?

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:43.000
Here it is.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:52.840
I won't tell anyone.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.180
What?

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:57.020
You don't want to drag me into this,

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:59.010
so you can't ask me to keep it a secret, right?

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:03.020
But I'm already being unfaithful to
the Maria-sama myself anyway.

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:05.420
The same as you...

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:09.960
Why didn't you tell us about Shimako-san?

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:12.630
We were keeping quiet
about it on purpose, okay?

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:13.990
Why?!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:18.300
Because we decided that
Shimako needed normal friends.

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:21.570
If you had learned of Shimako's secret,

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:25.640
you would probably have come to
interact with her differently, right?

00:06:26.050 --> 00:06:28.180
Even without knowing her circumstances,

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:33.780
we wanted you to be friends who
would be there for her unconditionally.

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:39.080
I don't think finding out about it would
make anyone hold it against her,

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:40.890
but she's self-conscious about it, so...

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.760
Sei-sama knew about it too, right?

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:48.600
Maybe it was because Sei-sama
knew Shimako-san too well,

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:50.900
that she couldn't bring herself
to take any drastic measures.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:53.370
But we cannot let things drag on like this.

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:56.170
She's Rosa Gigantea now, after all.

00:06:56.540 --> 00:07:01.310
At any rate, we need to make
Shimako reveal the secret herself.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:04.420
How? If we only had a
good pawn at our disposal...

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:06.480
If it is a pawn you want, there is one.

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:08.310
Toko-chan!

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:10.780
When did you get here?

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.190
Were you listening the whole time?

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:15.590
I just heard it, Sachiko Onee-sama.

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:18.520
Because you were all so
absorbed in your discussion.

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:22.790
So, what pawn?

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.370
I believe she will work, without fail.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.240
So, who is it?

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:29.400
Nijyo Noriko-san.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:44.320
Noriko-san seems rather cold, right?

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:46.620
She is always like that.

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:50.870
But even so, during lunch
break and after school,

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:52.630
she shows a different side of herself.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.290
Different side?

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:55.370
Would you like to see it?

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:56.130
What?

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:58.140
If you're not interested, that's fine too.

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:00.370
N-No, I'll go! I will go!

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:02.500
Then meet me behind the auditorium.

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:04.910
Please be sure to come alone.

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:17.190
What do you think?

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:22.430
I've never seen Shimako-san look like that...

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:26.670
Why? Is it because she's
with Nijyo Noriko-san?

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:29.230
Is she that precious to her?

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:31.470
Are we no good?

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:35.370
Yumi-sama?

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:42.040
Thank you. I'm going back now.

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:45.110
You are more sensitive than I had thought.

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:50.720
"Rosa Gigantea is growing
farther apart from us..."

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:54.050
Could a sad thought like that have
crossed your mind just now?

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.360
I thought I would get to see you if I came here.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.390
I wanted to see you, too.

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:06.500
Um...

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:10.810
I've been thinking, but...

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:15.020
Not saying isn't necessarily
the same as lying, right?

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:18.720
Besides, it just so happened that you
were born to a temple household,

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:21.880
so I don't think that's being unfaithful to God...

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:24.720
I'm not sure how to say this well...

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.490
You said it just fine.

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:37.540
Uh, um...

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:41.240
I was off looking at a Buddhist
statue on the day of the test...

00:09:41.240 --> 00:09:42.440
...and got stuck on my way home,

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:44.210
so I had no choice but to enroll at Lillian,

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:46.150
which I had applied to out of
respect for my great aunt...

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:01.380
Thank you.

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:02.730
That's enough.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:05.160
I won't drop out just yet.

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:09.470
Just yet?

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:13.170
If my circumstances become publicly known...

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:15.670
...and it makes trouble for someone,

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:19.170
I think I really should not remain at this school.

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:23.220
But Shimako-san, you like this school, don't you?

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:25.050
Of course.

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:27.210
Then...

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:38.220
I never imagined that I would find myself
having conversations like this at school.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:40.300
If you feel you can talk to me,

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:42.830
I would be happy to be there
for you whenever you like.

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:46.930
Oh yes. I almost forgot.

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.040
Do you like prayer beads, too?

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:50.000
Prayer beads?

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:53.500
I remembered that the prayer beads
that my grandmother had left me...

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:55.580
...includes a bead that
contains a Buddhist statue...

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.920
Thank you, Shimako-san!

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:16.630
I see.

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:18.400
And thus,

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:21.410
you were reluctant to even come to
the Rose Mansion during lunch...

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:24.640
...and you kept to your classroom
the whole time after that.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:25.670
Yes...

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:27.910
I won't say that I don't understand.

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:30.170
I am sorry.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.150
It's fine.

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:33.250
I am not bothered by it.

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:37.190
After all, you came and told me all about it.

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:41.020
So? Do you feel a little better now?

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:42.120
Yes.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:45.960
You dummy. Are you tearing up?

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:47.200
Because...

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:51.670
Come here.

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:16.800
Shimako-san no longer has an Onee-sama,
who will be kind to her like this.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:19.520
Someone who will accept her without a word...

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:24.130
If Shimako-san is looking for someone
she can comfort and be comforted by...

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:37.120
Onee-sama, I...

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:38.880
Sachiko Onee-sama!

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:42.320
What is it?

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:47.290
During lunch, Shimako-sama
and Noriko-san were meeting in secret...

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:48.930
I heard about that.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.960
But the problem is what
happened after Yumi-sama left.

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:56.170
Shimako-sama gave something to Noriko-san.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:57.230
Something?

00:12:57.470 --> 00:12:58.940
It was a drawstring pouch.

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:00.610
I was unable to see what was inside,

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:03.940
so I hardened my resolve and
I looked inside Noriko-san's bag...

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:06.240
...when she was away from the
classroom on cleaning duty!

00:13:07.110 --> 00:13:09.380
Toko-chan, that is a little...

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:10.610
This is friendship!

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:15.450
So, what was inside?

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:16.650
Prayer beads.

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:22.350
To think Shimako would bring
prayer beads to school...

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:25.120
Sounds like something we
could use as a prop, right?

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:28.900
To make Rosa Gigantea
reveal her secret herself...

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:31.040
True...

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:33.370
I already have a scenario in mind.

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:34.800
I call it,

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:37.640
"The Maria Festival Inquisition"!

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:45.280
And so, the day of the Maria Festival came.

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:55.330
Noriko-san.

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:58.260
The Lady Roses are here to see you.

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:08.010
Good day.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:10.270
Nijyo Noriko-san, correct?

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:11.210
Yes.

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:13.710
So, this girl is Shimako's...

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:16.480
Still in the rough, from the looks of it.

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:25.820
What are you doing?!

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:28.120
Oh? She fought back.

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:29.930
She's pretty ferocious.

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:31.490
Sorry for disturbing you.

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:33.090
Please hold on a minute!

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:37.630
You summoned me out here and
you're not even going to explain?!

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:42.040
The reason we came...

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:44.540
...was because we wanted to see your face.

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:47.270
We have a question for you as well.

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:50.170
Do you like Todo Shimako?

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:54.120
I... do, but...

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:57.120
Okay then. Good luck.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.320
"Good luck"? With what?

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:14.270
It's gone!

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:16.840
The prayer beads Shimako-san lent to me...

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:17.940
...are gone!

00:15:24.050 --> 00:15:25.580
To all of you first-year students,

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:28.720
let me begin by congratulating
you on your enrollment.

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:32.990
Now, here at the high school
division of Lillian Girls' Academy,

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:35.560
the student council is called
the "Yamayuri Council,"

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:36.730
which comes from the song
"Maria-sama's Heart."

00:15:36.730 --> 00:15:37.890
What should I do?
which comes from the song
"Maria-sama's Heart."

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:38.700
Thus, every year, on Maria-sama's Day,

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:40.100
Who in the world?
Thus, every year, on Maria-sama's Day,

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:41.590
Thus, every year, on Maria-sama's Day,

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:44.800
we conduct this ceremony to welcome
the new first-year students.

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:46.900
Shimako-san...

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:50.170
First, we have the presentation of medallions.

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:52.870
When your class is called,
come forward in a single file.

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:58.410
May Maria-sama watch over you.

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:01.850
May Maria-sama watch over you.

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:05.620
Shimako-san, never mind the Maria Festival...

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:07.330
May Maria-sama...

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:08.560
Please wait!

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:13.600
She is not worthy of receiving
a medallion from Rosa Gigantea!

00:16:13.670 --> 00:16:14.570
What?!

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:20.710
Toko-san...

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:23.870
I am sorry for interrupting this sacred ceremony.

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:32.720
What do you mean by that?

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:35.920
She is not worthy of receiving a medallion?

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:36.880
No.

00:16:47.430 --> 00:16:49.160
This is yours, isn't it, Noriko-san?

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:50.460
It is not.

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:53.740
Can you swear that to Maria-sama?

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:54.970
Yes.

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:59.550
Then you won't mind if I throw it away, right?!

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:08.180
If these prayer beads do not belong to you,

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:10.420
you should not care what happens to them.

00:17:18.130 --> 00:17:20.070
So the prayer beads are to be my test of faith.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:23.600
I understand. I will acknowledge it.

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:26.860
You are right, that is
something I brought with me.

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.330
Shimako-san, don't say anything unnecessary.

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:31.540
But...

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:35.680
It's okay. Their issue is with me right now.

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:38.480
A good attitude.

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:40.450
Please return those prayer beads to me.

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:43.850
If you want them back,
tell us who they belong to.

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:46.420
You said you brought them with you,

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:49.260
but you did not acknowledge
that they belong to you.

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:02.370
What should I do?

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:05.600
But right now, I have no choice but
to lie and say they belong to me...

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:13.520
Those prayer beads belong to me.

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:14.050
Shimako-san!
Those prayer beads belong to me.

00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:14.450
Shimako-san!

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:22.850
Will you explain yourself?

00:18:23.730 --> 00:18:28.060
Nijyo Norkio-san was only holding
on to my prayer beads for me.

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:29.030
Shima...

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:31.530
Please, don't interrupt her.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:32.260
What?

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:40.470
You are more devoutly Christian
than anyone here. Why?

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:52.250
Because my household is
that of a Buddhist temple.

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:09.370
I am sorry, after you went through
the trouble of defending me.

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:15.310
Shimako-san!

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:37.860
She finally said it.

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:42.330
Good grief. This year's sideshow
sure was a big production.

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:49.780
For having shown us such
beautiful sisterly love,

00:19:49.780 --> 00:19:53.310
please give a warm round of applause
to Shimako-san and Noriko-san!

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:08.930
Why did you keep it a secret all this time?

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:13.570
"The daughter of a temple must
not attend a Catholic school..."

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:16.010
Did you seriously believe that was true?

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:18.010
Sachiko-sama...

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:22.240
Honestly! I can't quite decide if
you're earnest or just stubborn.

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:25.420
Then, the circumstances of my family...

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:27.950
We knew, of course.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:30.520
Keeping it a secret seemed to pain you,

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:34.390
so we thought it would be best for you
to declare it in front of everyone,

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:37.120
but I'm sorry it ended up like we tricked you.

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:40.360
Not at all...

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:43.870
That was so fun!

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:45.870
I felt like I was playing a villain!

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:48.900
My!

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:50.780
I mean...

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:54.340
The Lady Roses most insistently
asked me to do this.

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:57.580
Noriko-san, you really should
make sure to lock up your bag.

00:20:58.590 --> 00:20:59.640
Toko!

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:02.420
Never mind that! Apologize first!

00:21:16.270 --> 00:21:18.670
Shimako-san's laughing...

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:27.450
The weight has been lifted from
Shimako-san's shoulders now, right?

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:28.310
Yes.

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:29.620
I'm glad.

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:33.410
Yumi, is there anything you want?

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:34.040
Pardon?

00:21:35.090 --> 00:21:37.680
I will give you something as a present.

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:40.430
Since I didn't get you
anything on White Day, either.

00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:44.050
Various things came up and
it is long overdue now, but...

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:46.030
Onee-sama...

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:48.990
It has been on my mind, you know.

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:51.140
Um...

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:51.800
What is it?

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:54.610
Then, how about a date for half a day?

00:21:54.940 --> 00:21:57.310
All right. Where do you want to go?

00:21:57.580 --> 00:21:58.540
The amusement park!

00:22:02.180 --> 00:22:06.620
Perhaps she dislikes noisy
places like amusement parks...

00:22:07.520 --> 00:22:09.960
I am not getting on any roller coasters, though.

00:22:12.760 --> 00:22:13.590
All right!

00:23:26.770 --> 00:23:29.370
The Rosa Gigantea, Shimako,
feels a special closeness...

00:23:29.370 --> 00:23:31.070
...to Noriko, a new student,

00:23:31.070 --> 00:23:33.130
but she could not yet bring
herself to give her the rosary.

00:23:33.210 --> 00:23:37.140
Watching them, I feel pitiful for
being unable to take that next step.

00:23:37.380 --> 00:23:40.380
With the rosary, Sachiko-sama
and Yumi-san became soeurs...

00:23:40.380 --> 00:23:42.370
...and their relationship seems
so beautiful and pure...

00:23:42.480 --> 00:23:43.720
And there's the example of
Yoshino-san and Rei-sama,

00:23:43.720 --> 00:23:47.240
who continue their pleasant
relationship even after the rosary...

00:23:47.420 --> 00:23:49.420
This preview is lacking punch somehow.

00:23:49.420 --> 00:23:49.860
Next time on "Maria Watches Over Us,"

00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:51.060
Next time on "Maria Watches Over Us,"
Next Time "Tears of the Rosary"

00:23:51.060 --> 00:23:52.690
"TEARS OF THE ROSARY"!
Next Time "Tears of the Rosary"

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:54.730
That sounds so threatening!
Next Time "Tears of the Rosary"

00:23:54.730 --> 00:23:55.750
Next Time "Tears of the Rosary"
